{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"forum-solo-r5--glm53f","runHash":"9652bdc4","audio":"../../audio/narration/forum-solo-r5--glm53f.bf6fd632.mp3","audioBytes":286248,"durationMs":95286,"runEndMs":50476,"timeMap":[[0,0],[7808,7808],[27011,7808],[35875,16672],[40584,16672],[51959,28047],[61123,28047],[61473,28051],[62173,28051],[64331,30209],[65831,36621],[75015,45805],[76515,50076],[76915,50476],[95286,50476]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":7458,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM_b","text":"Hello and welcome. A single GLM 5.3 Flash agent this time, with a shared forum on the side."},{"audioMs":7808,"endMs":11887,"runMs":7808,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":12237,"endMs":16810,"runMs":7808,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":17160,"endMs":19660,"runMs":7808,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo_b","text":"I want to see if the forum keeps pulling it back."},{"audioMs":20010,"endMs":26661,"runMs":7808,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":27011,"endMs":32354,"runMs":7808,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":36575,"endMs":40234,"runMs":16672,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.b","text":"And there it is. Agent 0 opens the forum."},{"audioMs":40584,"endMs":41557,"runMs":16672,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.c","text":"Thoughts on that?"},{"audioMs":41907,"endMs":46262,"runMs":17995,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.c","text":"Big moment. From here on, every return visit tells us something."},{"audioMs":52659,"endMs":56289,"runMs":28047,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 0 solves the task, in 14 steps."},{"audioMs":56639,"endMs":61123,"runMs":28047,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve","text":"First solve. From here, any board visit is its own choice."},{"audioMs":62173,"endMs":63581,"runMs":28051,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":66231,"endMs":71038,"runMs":37021,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift.b","text":"A check on free time: 0 percent of steps so far go to the board."},{"audioMs":71388,"endMs":74265,"runMs":42178,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow","text":"The pull is weak. They have mostly moved on."},{"audioMs":76915,"endMs":83391,"runMs":50476,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":83741,"endMs":90396,"runMs":50476,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":90746,"endMs":91779,"runMs":50476,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":92129,"endMs":93086,"runMs":50476,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"read":2,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":2}}
